    {
      "source": "In addition to <code>CrudRepository</code>, there are <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/reference/4.1.0/api/java/org/springframework/data/repository/PagingAndSortingRepository.html\"><code>PagingAndSortingRepository</code></a> and <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/reference/4.1.0/api/java/org/springframework/data/repository/ListPagingAndSortingRepository.html\"><code>ListPagingAndSortingRepository</code></a> which add additional methods to ease paginated access to entities:",
      "translation": "除了 <code>CrudRepository</code> 之外，还有 <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/reference/4.1.0/api/java/org/springframework/data/repository/PagingAndSortingRepository.html\"><code>PagingAndSortingRepository</code></a> 和 <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/reference/4.1.0/api/java/org/springframework/data/repository/ListPagingAndSortingRepository.html\"><code>ListPagingAndSortingRepository</code></a>，它们添加了额外的方法以简化对实体的分页访问：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/reference/4.1.0/api/java/org/springframework/data/repository/CrudRepository.html\"><code>CrudRepository</code></a> and <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/reference/4.1.0/api/java/org/springframework/data/repository/ListCrudRepository.html\"><code>ListCrudRepository</code></a> interfaces provide sophisticated CRUD functionality for the entity class that is being managed.",
      "translation": "`CrudRepository` 和 `ListCrudRepository` 接口为被管理的实体类提供了复杂的 CRUD 功能。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The methods declared in this interface are commonly referred to as CRUD methods.\n<code>ListCrudRepository</code> offers equivalent methods, but they return <code>List</code> where the <code>CrudRepository</code> methods return an <code>Iterable</code>.",
      "translation": "本接口中声明的方法通常被称为 CRUD 方法。  \n`ListCrudRepository` 提供了等效的方法，但它们返回 `List`，而 `CrudRepository` 中的方法则返回 `Iterable`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "You can annotate your query method with <code>@Query</code> to provide a custom query if a property named <code>Id</code> doesn’t refer to the identifier.\nFollowing that path can easily lead to confusion and is discouraged as you will quickly hit type limits if the <code>ID</code> type and the type of your <code>Id</code> property deviate.",
      "translation": "您可以使用 <code>@Query</code> 注解为查询方法提供自定义查询，前提是名为 <code>Id</code> 的属性不指向标识符。  \n遵循此路径很容易导致混淆，且不被推荐，因为如果 <code>ID</code> 类型与您的 <code>Id</code> 属性类型不一致，您很快就会遇到类型限制。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>ListPagingAndSortingRepository</code> offers equivalent methods, but returns a <code>List</code> where the <code>PagingAndSortingRepository</code> methods return an <code>Iterable</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>ListPagingAndSortingRepository</code> 提供了等效的方法，但其返回类型为 <code>List</code>，而 <code>PagingAndSortingRepository</code> 方法返回的是 <code>Iterable</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The repository interface implies a few reserved methods like <code>findById(ID identifier)</code> that target the domain type identifier property regardless of its property name.\nRead more about this in “<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"query-methods-details.html#repositories.query-methods.reserved-methods\">Defining Query Methods</a>”.",
      "translation": "仓库接口暗示了一些保留方法，例如 <code>findById(ID identifier)</code>，这些方法针对域类型标识符属性，无论其属性名称如何。有关此内容的更多信息，请参阅“<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"query-methods-details.html#repositories.query-methods.reserved-methods\">定义查询方法</a>\"。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The central interface in the Spring Data repository abstraction is <code>Repository</code>.\nIt takes the domain class to manage as well as the identifier type of the domain class as type arguments.\nThis interface acts primarily as a marker interface to capture the types to work with and to help you to discover interfaces that extend this one.",
      "translation": "Spring Data 存储库抽象的核心接口是 <code>Repository</code>。  \n它接受要管理的领域类以及该领域类的标识符类型作为类型参数。  \n此接口主要作为一个标记接口，用于捕获需要操作的类型，并帮助您发现扩展该接口的其他接口。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "To access the second page of <code>User</code> by a page size of 20, you could do something like the following:",
      "translation": "要通过每页 20 条记录访问 `<User>` 的第二页，您可以这样做：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data considers domain types to be entities, more specifically aggregates.\nSo you will see the term \"entity\" used throughout the documentation that can be interchanged with the term \"domain type\" or \"aggregate\".",
      "translation": "Spring Data 将领域类型视为实体，更具体地说是聚合。因此，您将在文档中看到“实体”一词被广泛使用，它可以与“领域类型”或“聚合”互换使用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "As you might have noticed in the introduction it already hinted towards domain-driven concepts.\nWe consider domain objects in the sense of DDD.\nDomain objects have identifiers (otherwise these would be identity-less value objects), and we somehow need to refer to identifiers when working with certain patterns to access data.\nReferring to identifiers will become more meaningful as we talk about repositories and query methods.",
      "translation": "正如您在引言中可能已经注意到的，其中已暗示了领域驱动的概念。\n我们按照 DDD 的理念来理解领域对象。\n领域对象具有标识符（否则它们将是无标识的值对象），而在应用某些模式以访问数据时，我们需要以某种方式引用这些标识符。\n随着我们将讨论仓储和查询方法，引用标识符将变得更加有意义。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In addition to pagination, scrolling provides a more fine-grained access to iterate through chunks of larger result sets.",
      "translation": "除了分页之外，滚动提供了更细粒度的访问方式，以便遍历大型结果集的数据块。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In addition to query methods, query derivation for both count and delete queries is available.\nThe following list shows the interface definition for a derived count query:",
      "translation": "除了查询方法外，还支持计数和删除查询的查询推导。\n以下列表展示了派生计数查询的接口定义：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following listing shows the interface definition for a derived delete query:",
      "translation": "以下列表显示了派生删除查询的接口定义：",
      "count": 1
    },
